    {
      "id": "PA-C216-kall",
      "sequence": 11810,
      "title": "ਕੱਲ੍ਹ (kallh) (kall) — yesterday; tomorrow",
      "headword": "ਕੱਲ੍ਹ",
      "romanization": "kallh",
      "gloss": "yesterday; tomorrow",
      "script": "gurmukhi",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:4581fbb3af57360f",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new sense: say Aman went home, then the farewell ਕੱਲ੍ਹ (kallh) ਮਿਲਾਂਗੇ, \"we will meet tomorrow\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ਕੱਲ੍ਹ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਕੱਲ੍ਹ (kallh) — kall — \"yesterday; tomorrow\". It names the day one step from today, either way; the verb tells you which."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਅਮਨ ਕੱਲ੍ਹ ਘਰ ਗਿਆ। — Aman kallh ghar giā. — Aman went home yesterday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With a went form it is yesterday; in ਕੱਲ੍ਹ (kallh) ਮਿਲਾਂਗੇ it is tomorrow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਕੱਲ੍ਹ (kallh) (kall) is inherited from Sanskrit kālya, \"at dawn; tomorrow\": CDIAL lists Punjabi kall, \"yesterday, tomorrow\" (CDIAL 3104)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for talking about the past."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "kall",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *kall*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "the girl went to school yesterday",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *the girl went to school yesterday*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਕੁੜੀ ਕੱਲ੍ਹ (kallh) ਸਕੂਲ ਗਈ।."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
